{
  "title": "Ewald summation",
  "html": "<h1>Ewald summation</h1><p>Ewald summation evaluates periodic Coulomb interactions through complementary real- and reciprocal-space sums. It defines a different boundary-value problem from simply truncating 1/r at a finite radius.</p><h2 id=\"model\">Problem and representative equations</h2><p>Consider point charges qᵢ in a neutral, triply periodic cell. Set rᵢⱼₙ=rᵢ−rⱼ+n, cell volume V, splitting parameter α&gt;0 and reciprocal vector k. S(k) is the charge structure factor. The energy below uses unit Coulomb prefactor, omits k=0 and assumes a conducting macroscopic boundary. The prime excludes only i=j,n=0.</p><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>E</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">n</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></munderover><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">erfc</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>α</mi><msqrt><mi>π</mi></msqrt></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{aligned}S(\\mathbf k)&amp;=\\sum_jq_j e^{i\\mathbf k\\cdot\\mathbf r_j},\\\\E&amp;=\\frac12\\sum_{i,j,\\mathbf n}^{\\prime}q_iq_j\\frac{\\operatorname{erfc}(\\alpha r_{ij\\mathbf n})}{r_{ij\\mathbf n}}+\\frac{2\\pi}{V}\\sum_{\\mathbf k\\ne0}\\frac{e^{-k^2/(4\\alpha^2)}}{k^2}|S(\\mathbf k)|^2-\\frac{\\alpha}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\sum_iq_i^2.\\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:5.9409em;vertical-align:-2.7204em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2205em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.9093em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.7389em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4567em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.7389em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7204em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2205em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.9093em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.7389em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"ps